; Imports from winmm.dll for the SDK-free verification build.
;
; A single entry: PlaySoundA, which plays OBVR's own wave files (the slap,
; game/GameSound.h). The @12 suffix is the stdcall name decoration on x86
; and matches the three arguments (the name, the module, the flags).
LIBRARY winmm.dll
EXPORTS
PlaySoundA@12
